Layout.StyleSheet:
@page {
  margin: 16mm 12mm 14mm 12mm;
  @top-left      { content: "@top-left";      font-family: monospace; font-size: 7pt; vertical-align: bottom; }
  @top-center    { content: "@top-center";    font-family: monospace; font-size: 7pt; vertical-align: bottom; }
  @top-right     { content: "@top-right";     font-family: monospace; font-size: 7pt; vertical-align: bottom; }
  @bottom-left   { content: "@bottom-left";   font-family: monospace; font-size: 7pt; vertical-align: top; }
  @bottom-center { content: "Page " counter(page); font-family: sans; font-size: 7pt; vertical-align: top; }
  @bottom-right  { content: "@bottom-right";  font-family: monospace; font-size: 7pt; vertical-align: top; }
}
p { font-family: sans; font-size: 9pt; }
